<title>PHILIPPINES: Asiatrust nine-mth net 177.7 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Asiatrust nine-mth net 177.7 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Asiatrust Development Bank posted a net income of 177.7 million pesos in the first nine months ended March 31, documents submitted to the Philippine Stock Exchange on Monday showed.</p>
<p>The bank said it was targetting a 250.68 million peso net income for the fiscal year ending June 30, 1997, from 150 million pesos registered a year ago.</p>
</text>
